    "detailed_description": "Merge small cute animals into bigger cute animals. Measure your skills by playing this puzzle game and achieving the highest score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMerge Circus is an adorable physics-based puzzle game where you take the role of a small magician who's trying to fill his magical hat with cute animals. Can you help him achieve his goal of getting the biggest and cutest animal?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udc0b Merge two identical animals into a bigger animal. The bigger the animal the more space it takes up!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Strategize and use physics to your own advantage. Be creative and methodical while earning points and getting the highest score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f The game is full of all kinds of animals from around the world. Land, sea, or air, they're all cute!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfaa A cozy and comforting environment with nice gameplay that is engaging!",
